      "title": "Abdul El-Sayed’s campaign disinvites Haley Stevens from events to limit ‘distractions’",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/abdul-el-sayed-haley-stevens-disinvited-from-events",
      "description": "<p>A public spat has cast Democratic tensions in the spotlight as the close US Senate race draws to a head</p><p>Abdul El-Sayed, the Democratic nominee for Michigan’s tightly fought US Senate race, has asked Democratic congresswoman Haley Stevens <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/el-sayed-stevens-senate-race-fight-01144423\">to stay away</a> from his campaign events.</p><p>“I don’t want any distractions,” El-Sayed told reporters after a campaign rally, <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/10/31/us/midterms-elections-trump\">according to the New York Times</a>. “It seems as though other folks are more interested in making this race about things that it’s not about.”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/31/abdul-el-sayed-haley-stevens-disinvited-from-events\">Continue reading...</a>",
